{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=May 2018}}
'''Group 3 of the [[1970 FIFA World Cup]]''' was contested in [[Guadalajara]]'s [[Estadio Jalisco]] between 2 and 11 June 1970. [[Brazil national football team|Brazil]] won the group, and advanced to the quarter-finals, along with World Cup holders [[England national football team|England]]. [[Romania national football team|Romania]] and [[Czechoslovakia national football team|Czechoslovakia]] failed to advance.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.fifa.com/tournaments/archive/worldcup/mexico1970/index.html|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20131220185153/http://www.fifa.com/tournaments/archive/worldcup/mexico1970/index.html|url-status=dead|archive-date=20 December 2013|title=1970 FIFA World Cup Mexico|publisher=fifa.com|accessdate=10 August 2014}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/70full.html |title=World Cup 1970 |accessdate=10 August 2014 |url-status=live |archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20160701154217/http://www.rsssf.com/tables/70full.html |archivedate=1 July 2016 |website=[[RSSSF]] |df= }}</ref>

